      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T19:18:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I gave Chris this suggestion.\n\nI wanted to minimize other symbols that need to be exported (`__fixup_exception`), since it\u0027s a decently internal arm64 function. Also we want to be open about what we\u0027re doing inside `do_sea`. We could create a vendor hook that would behave like a static key, but then why not just use a static key? Let me know your thoughts behind the rationale here.",
      "parentUuid": "fe4d8a39_98bb1de0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 49,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "1a38c2c1c609fb273bd61cdfea612a05fb790ed7",
